Zinzolin first appeared in The Uprising, where he was shown at N's Castle as it was rising from the ground and surrounding the Unova .

Zinzolin made another appearance in The Frozen World, this time wearing the clothes his game counterpart wears in . He and several s battled Drayden during Team Plasma's attack on Opelucid City. After Colress used to freeze the city, Zinzolin was able to steal the DNA Splicers from Drayden.
